<section class="band" aria-labelledby="home-research">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="home-research">Research</h2>
      <a class="more" href="research.html">Research overview</a>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lead">Lignin and biorefinery byproducts carry too much oxygen to go into a refinery. I study how molybdenum oxide strips that oxygen at ambient hydrogen pressure while keeping the C=C bonds and aromatic rings that make the products valuable, and what it takes to run that chemistry on real, mixed feeds for long enough to matter.</p>
    <ul class="cards">
      {%- for p in collections.projects %}{% if not p.data.home_hidden %}
      <li class="card">
        <a href="{{ p.data.permalink }}">
          <span class="status status-{{ p.data.status_kind or 'progress' }}">{{ p.data.status }}</span>
          <span class="card-title">{{ p.data.short_title or p.data.title | safe }}</span>
          {%- if p.data.reaction %}<span class="reaction reaction-sm">{{ p.data.reaction | safe }}</span>{% endif %}
          <span class="card-text">{{ p.data.summary | safe }}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
